%% UC-01 — Register & sign in (OIDC Authorization Code + PKCE)
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor P as Participant
    participant F as Flutter App
    participant KC as Keycloak
    participant B as Backend (Express)

    P->>F: Tap "Sign in"
    F->>F: Generate code_verifier + code_challenge (S256)
    F->>KC: GET /auth/realms/hhh/.../auth?response_type=code&code_challenge=...
    KC-->>F: Login page
    P->>KC: Enter credentials
    KC-->>F: 302 hhh://callback?code=...
    F->>KC: POST /token (code + code_verifier)<br/>scope: openid profile email offline_access
    KC-->>F: access_token, refresh_token, id_token
    Note over F,KC: offline_access binds the refresh token to the 180-day<br/>rolling offline session, not the 30-min SSO session.<br/>Silent refresh on each open resets the idle clock
    F->>F: Store tokens in flutter_secure_storage
    F->>B: GET /api/v1/users/me (Bearer access_token)
    B->>B: Verify RS256 sig via cached JWKS, check roles
    B-->>F: 200 user preferences
